> this is my .asoundrc:
> 
> pcm.bluetooth_raw {
> type bluetooth
> device 00:02:78:29:3F:D4
> profile "voice"
> }
> 
> pcm.bluetooth {
> type plug
> slave {
> pcm "bluetooth_raw"
> }
